    built: 'When the driver taps Out for Delivery on the tablet, the app builds a tracking email whose button opens the website\'s Track Order page with a signed token (falling back to the internal live map with the destination pin when the store URL is not configured), lists what is on the truck — only the repaired item for a rework trip — and posts it to this webhook for immediate sending.',
    steps: ['Driver tablet → Out for Delivery → sendOutForDeliveryEmail(order, pin).', 'Track URL: <store>/track?order=…&t=<token>, else /track-preview.html?order&dlat&dlng&pin.', 'Subject "Your order is on the way — ORD…"; items on this trip (rework = repaired item only).', 'POST → Webhook → Send Tracking Email.'],
