    steps: ['Tablet → Arrived → POST /api/delivery/arrive (rate-limited).', 'Build item cards from receipt_items (rework = repaired item only) + DELIVERED / THIS DELIVERY / NEXT DELIVERY tags.', 'Gmail parcel schema: OrderInTransit, expected arrival today; preheader "Installation & setup starts now".', 'POST → Webhook → Send Arrived Email.'],
