    problem: 'Delivery dates agreed on the phone were forgotten or disputed, and operations could not tell who had actually confirmed.',
    built: 'When operations sets a date and team for a group in the Delivery Queue, sendGroupConfirmations emails every order in the group at once: date, team, COD amount and a single Confirm Delivery Date button that lands on a tokenised confirm page. Redelivery after rework uses the same shape with different wording. Orders left Awaiting Confirm are picked up by the daily follow-up sweep. The email goes through the outbox with an idempotency key and out via this webhook.',
    steps: ['Delivery Queue → set date + team + coordinator for a group → sendGroupConfirmations.', 'Per order: subject with order number and date; Confirm Delivery Date → /delivery-confirm/<dq_token>; "Need a different date? Reply or message us".', 'Order marked Awaiting Confirm (dq_sent_at); unanswered ones get the 6 AM follow-ups.', 'POST → Webhook → Send Email (Gmail).'],
